type: software
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: MIT
abstract: "Code, locked dataset manifests, saved results and verification scripts for PropGate (frozen BioCLIP 2 features, k-NN label propagation and a reference-calibrated acceptance gate) for low-label medicinal plant recognition when unlabeled archives contain unknown species, including the additional experiments: OOD-filtered self-training, zero-shot and fine-tuning baselines, k x alpha sensitivity, other encoders and a development-class grid."
keywords:
  - medicinal plant recognition
  - low-label learning
  - label propagation
  - unknown-class contamination
  - BioCLIP 2
  - PropGate
  - open-set semi-supervised learning
